      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just walked through my apartment and it felt like i was looking at a museum of someone else's life. everything is so quiet. i don't even recognize the person looking back at me in the mirror anymore. it's like the real me was tied to him, and since he's gone, there's just... nothing left here. just a shell.",
